msgid ""
"If enabled, external level file names will be prefixed with an index reflecting their position in the internal array.\n"
"This is NOT recommended because, with versioning systems (such as GIT), inserting a new level means renaming files of all subsequent levels in the array.\n"
"This option used to be the default behavior but was changed in version 1.0.0."
msgstr ""
"如果启用，外部关卡文件名将以反映其在内部数组中位置的索引为前缀。\n"
"不建议这样做，因为使用版本控制系统（如 GIT）时，插入新关卡意味着需要重命名数组中所有后续关卡的文件。\n"
"此选项曾是默认行为，但在 1.0.0 版本中已更改。"

msgid "If enabled, levels will be stored in a 'worlds' array at the root of the project JSON instead of the root itself directly.\nThis option is still experimental and is not yet supported if Separate Levels option is enabled."
msgstr ""
"如果启用，关卡将存储在项目 JSON 根目录下的 'worlds' 数组中，而不是直接存储在根目录中。\n"
"此选项仍处于实验阶段，如果启用了"分离关卡"选项，则尚不支持。"

msgid "If enabled, the 'toc' field in the project JSON will contain an 'instances' array in addition of the new 'instanceData' array (see JSON online doc for more info)."
msgstr "如果启用，项目 JSON 中的 'toc' 字段除了新的 'instanceData' 数组外，还将包含 'instances' 数组（详情请参阅 JSON 在线文档）。"

