msgid ""
"Sorry but LDtk does not support working on a Network Drive yet.\n"
"So, for your own safety, operations on Network Drives are not permitted for now to avoid errors and potential data loss."
msgstr ""
"抱歉，LDtk 尚不支持在网络驱动器上工作。\n"
"为了您的数据安全，目前不允许在网络驱动器上操作，以避免错误和潜在的数据丢失。"

msgid "Sorry, but I can't restore this backup: I can't locate the original project file."
msgstr "抱歉，无法恢复此备份：无法找到原始项目文件。"

msgid "Stop using this image?"
msgstr "停止使用此图片？"

