msgstr "文本文件"

msgid ""
"The WebGL context was lost!\n"
"Don't worry, it's probably nothing, and no data was lost. You should just save your work and restart the application."
msgstr ""
"WebGL 上下文已丢失！\n"
"不用担心，这可能没什么问题，没有数据丢失。您只需保存工作并重启应用程序即可。"

msgid ""
"The WebGL context was lost!\n"
"You need to restart the application."
msgstr ""
"WebGL 上下文已丢失！\n"
"您需要重启应用程序。"

msgid "The current layer settings prevent its rules to work."
msgstr "当前图层设置导致其规则无法工作。"

msgid "The file you're trying to save is a ::app:: sample map.\nAny change to it will be lost during automatic updates, so it's NOT recommended to modify it."
msgstr ""
"您尝试保存的文件是 ::app:: 示例地图。\n"
"任何更改都将在自动更新时丢失，因此不建议修改它。"

msgid "The following file cannot be found anymore:"
msgstr "以下文件已无法找到："

msgid "The following file has been modified externally and should be updated:"
msgstr "以下文件已被外部修改，需要更新："

msgid "The identifier \\"
msgstr "标识符 \\"

msgid "The new grid size is larger than the previous one.\nSome tiles may have been lost in the remapping process."
msgstr ""
"新的网格大小大于之前的网格大小。\n"
"在重新映射过程中，部分图块可能已丢失。"

msgid "The project file is no longer in ::path::. Save to this path anyway?"
msgstr "项目文件已不在 ::path:: 中。是否仍要保存到此路径？"

msgid "The project was NOT saved properly!"
msgstr "项目未正确保存！"

msgid "The select project doesn't match this backup."
msgstr "所选项目与此备份不匹配。"

msgid "The selected file has a different name: are you sure it's the one? Selecting a different file may have dramatic results."
msgstr "所选文件名称不同：您确定是这个文件吗？选择不同的文件可能会导致严重后果。"

msgid "This auto-layer doesn't have a tileset. Please pick one in the LAYERS panel."
msgstr "此自动图层没有图块集。请在"图层"面板中选择一个。"

msgid "This conversion will TRANSFORM EXISTING VALUES because the target type isn't fully compatible with the previous one!\nSome data might be lost in the process because of this conversion.\nPlease make sure that you known what you're doing here."
msgstr ""
"此转换将改变现有值，因为目标类型与原类型不完全兼容！\n"
"由于此转换，过程中可能会丢失部分数据。\n"
"请确保您了解此操作的后果。"

msgid "This entity is not used and can be safely removed."
msgstr "此实体未被使用，可以安全移除。"

msgid "This enum is not used and can be safely removed."
msgstr "此枚举未被使用，可以安全移除。"

msgid "This file is empty: ::path::"
msgstr "此文件为空：::path::"

msgid "This file name is already in use."
msgstr "此文件名已被使用。"

msgid "This layer cannot be baked, as at least one other auto-layer rely on it as 'source' for its data."
msgstr "此图层无法烘焙，因为至少有一个其他自动图层将其作为数据"来源"。"

msgid "This project contains no Enum yet. You first need to create one from the Enum panel."
msgstr "此项目尚未包含枚举。您需要先从枚举面板中创建一个。"

msgid "This selection can't be moved around because it contains elements using different grid sizes."
msgstr "此选区无法移动，因为它包含使用不同网格大小的元素。"

msgid ""
"This tag is used in other elements!\n"
"Do you want to rename it in ALL other elements as well, or only here?"
msgstr ""
"此标签在其他元素中也有使用！\n"
"您要在所有其他元素中也重命名它，还是仅在此处重命名？"

msgid "This tile layer has no Tileset."
msgstr "此图块图层没有图块集。"

msgid "This value is used in some levels: removing it will also remove the value from all these levels. Are you sure?"
msgstr "此值在某些关卡中使用：移除它也将从所有这些关卡中移除该值。确定吗？"

