msgstr "警告！此枚举值在一个或多个实体实例中使用。这些值也将被移除！"

msgid ""
"WARNING!\n"
"Please make sure the game engine or importer you're using supports this kind of LDtk identifier!\n"
"Are you sure?"
msgstr ""
"警告！\n"
"请确保您使用的游戏引擎或导入工具支持此类 LDtk 标识符！\n"
"确定吗？"

msgid ""
"WARNING!\n"
"Please make sure the game engine or importer you're using supports this kind of LDtk identifier!\n"
"If you proceed, all identifiers in this project will be converted to the new format!\n"
"Are you sure?"
msgstr ""
"警告！\n"
"请确保您使用的游戏引擎或导入工具支持此类 LDtk 标识符！\n"
"如果继续，此项目中的所有标识符将被转换为新格式！\n"
"确定吗？"

msgid "WARNING: removing this external enum will also remove ALL the external enums from the same source! Please note that this will also affect all Entities using any of these enums in ALL levels."
msgstr "警告：移除此外部枚举也将移除同一来源的所有外部枚举！请注意，这也将影响所有关卡中使用这些枚举的所有实体。"

msgid ""
"WARNING: restoring this backup will REPLACE the original project file with this version.\n"
"Are you sure?"
msgstr ""
"警告：恢复此备份将用此版本替换原始项目文件。\n"
"确定吗？"

msgid ""
"Warning! This IntGrid layer is used by another one as SOURCE. Deleting it will also delete all rules in the corresponding auto-layer(s)!\n"
" You may want to change these layers source to another one before..."
msgstr ""
"警告！此 IntGrid 图层被另一个图层用作数据来源。删除它也将删除对应自动图层中的所有规则！\n"
"您可能需要先将这些图层的来源更改为其他图层..."

msgid "Warning: by removing the OPTIONAL status of this group, you will lose the on/off state of this group in all levels. The group of rules will become a 'global' one, applied to every levels."
msgstr "警告：移除此分组的可选状态后，您将丢失此分组在所有关卡中的开/关状态。该规则分组将变为"全局"分组，应用于所有关卡。"

msgid "Warning: the TILESET grid (::tileset::px) differs from the LAYER grid (::layer::px), and the values aren't multiples, which can lead to unexpected behaviors when adding a group of tiles."
msgstr "警告：图块集网格 (::tileset::px) 与图层网格 (::layer::px) 不同，且数值不是倍数关系，这可能在添加图块组时导致意外行为。"

msgid "Warning: using this tileset in this layer will mess any existing tiles here."
msgstr "警告：在此图层中使用此图块集将打乱此处的所有现有图块。"

